{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo gives you a hands-on look at the upcoming action RPG, <strong>Excoverse</strong>. Step into the shoes of the noble lord for the first hour of gameplay, featuring:</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 Stealth and combat introduction</strong> \u2014 Learn the basics of silent takedowns and fast-paced hack-and-slash action.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 Explore the opening area</strong> \u2014 Traverse the shadowy forest region, uncover hidden secrets, and meet key NPCs.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 Story preview</strong> \u2014 Experience the prologue cutscenes that set the stage for your desperate quest.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 Character progression sample</strong> \u2014 Test early abilities and experiment with artifact upgrades.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo covers approximately 45\u201360 minutes of gameplay. Please note: progress made in this demo will <strong>not</strong> carry over to the full game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3775290?t=1748796330","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3775290?t=1748796330","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775290/907f4c51b21d149caf5e8b3805cdd01dad74bdf3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748796330","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775290/907f4c51b21d149caf5e8b3805cdd01dad74bdf3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748796330","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game features stylized anime and fantasy-themed combat. There is no depiction of blood, but visual effects such as light bursts emphasize combat scenes. The game includes sword fighting, an optional stealth mechanic, and some finishing moves that may contain content some players might find disturbing."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo gives you a hands-on look at the upcoming action RPG, <strong>Excoverse</strong>. Step into the shoes of the noble lord for the first hour of gameplay, featuring:</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 Stealth and combat introduction</strong> \u2014 Learn the basics of silent takedowns and fast-paced hack-and-slash action.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 Explore the opening area</strong> \u2014 Traverse the shadowy forest region, uncover hidden secrets, and meet key NPCs.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 Story preview</strong> \u2014 Experience the prologue cutscenes that set the stage for your desperate quest.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 Character progression sample</strong> \u2014 Test early abilities and experiment with artifact upgrades.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo covers approximately 45\u201360 minutes of gameplay. Please note: progress made in this demo will <strong>not</strong> carry over to the full game.</p>","developers":["ExContinium Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3039230","name":"Excoverse"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775290/3c183a4c90d109325cc5de45dd9c5a3f5b69ffc8/header.jpg?t=1748796330","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 ExContinium Games. All rights reserved. Excoverse and all associated logos and characters are trademarks of ExContinium Games. Unauthorized copying, distribution, or modification of this product is strictly prohibited.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_